      "writtenOn": "2022-08-01T15:26:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I had discussed this with Brian and John, but we felt doing so would be more verbose and reduce the readability at the call sites.\n\n`CtsEnforcement::kNever` would become `CtsEnforcement::ApiLevel::kNever`\n`CtsEnforcement::kApiLevel_T` would become `CtsEnforcement::ApiLevel::kT`\n\nThe first case being more verbose and the second having reduced readability with just having `kT` or even just `T` as the enum value.",
      "parentUuid": "8f296ffd_c64eff14",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 16,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 16,
        "endChar": 14
      },
